<ttl id="1001I_S000I_744CL_T004H" variety="T004H">
<name>Smart Entry &amp; Start System (Smart Entry)</name>
<para id="RM000001HXC00IX" category="J" type-id="800QA" name-id="622PD-00" from="200612">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Inside verification not performed</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000001HXC00IX_05" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000029D00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The smart key computer assembly (certification ECU) transmits a request signal to each interior antenna (front, rear and luggage). If the electrical key transmitter is inside the vehicle, the electrical key transmitter receives the request signal and returns its ID code. The smart key computer assembly (certification ECU) determines that the electrical key transmitter is inside the vehicle by verifying the ID code returned from the electrical key transmitter via the door control receiver.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>The Smart Entry &amp; Start System (smart entry) has functions that use multiplex communication. First, follow "How to Proceed with Troubleshooting" and confirm that there is no malfunction in the communication system before proceeding with troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When using TaSCAN with the ignition switch OFF, repeatedly turn any door courtesy light switch ON←→OFF until communication between TaSCAN and the vehicle starts. (ON←→OFF interval within 1.5 seconds)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>The system may not operate normally due to radio wave interference from the vehicle environment, dealer-installed parts, etc.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When the electrical key transmitter or smart key computer assembly (certification ECU) has been replaced, refer to the registration procedure in the immobiliser reference section.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Check that there are no other electrical key transmitters in the vehicle interior.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001HXC00IX_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000029300000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
