<testgrp id="RM000001HXC00IX_04_0013" proc-id="RM0550J___000029700000">
<testtitle>Inspect Smart Function</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Remove the transmitter battery from the electrical key transmitter.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Hold the electrical key transmitter over the engine switch and check that the meter buzzer sounds.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that the power can be turned to IG ON when the engine switch is operated.</ptxt>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.65in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.48in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Engine switch can be operated</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Engine switch cannot be operated</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001HXC00IX_04_0022" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000001HXC00IX_04_0024" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001HXC00IX_04_0022" proc-id="RM0550J___000029B00000">
<testtitle>Radio Wave Environment Check</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Install the transmitter battery to the electrical key transmitter.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Bring the electrical key transmitter close to the indoor electrical key oscillator (front interior transmitter) and check that the engine starts.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Communication is not possible within 20cm of the front interior transmitter.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Bring the electrical key transmitter close to the indoor electrical key oscillator (rear interior transmitter) and check that the engine starts.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Communication is not possible within 20cm of the rear interior transmitter.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Bring the electrical key transmitter close to the indoor electrical key oscillator (luggage interior transmitter) and check that the engine starts.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Communication is not possible within 20cm of the luggage interior transmitter.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</test1>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Bringing the electrical key transmitter close to the indoor electrical key oscillator makes it less susceptible to interfering radio waves, so it can be determined whether the problem is caused by interfering radio waves.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If operation can be confirmed as a result of the inspection, interfering radio waves are the likely cause. Also, dealer-installed parts etc. may cause radio wave interference, so if any dealer-installed parts are present, remove them and check the operation.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.82in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.31in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation cannot be confirmed in either case</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation can be confirmed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001HXC00IX_04_0012" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000001HXC00IX_04_0028" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001HXC00IX_04_0012" proc-id="RM0550J___000029600000">
<testtitle>TaSCAN Electronic Key Diagnosis Mode</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Diagnosis Mode Inspection (Front Interior Antenna)</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B152470J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), select "Certification" → "Electronic Key Diagnosis Mode" → "Fr Interior Transmission → Interior Tuner".</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check that the wireless door lock buzzer sounds (beep, beep...) when the electrical key transmitter is placed on the driver side or front passenger side front seat cushion.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Diagnosis Mode Inspection (Rear Interior Antenna)</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B152487J02" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), select "Certification" → "Electronic Key Diagnosis Mode" → "Rr Interior Transmission → Interior Tuner".</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check that the wireless door lock buzzer sounds (continuous beep) when the electrical key transmitter is placed on the rear seat cushion.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Diagnosis Mode Inspection (Luggage Interior Antenna)</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B159664" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), select "Certification" → "Electronic Key Diagnosis Mode" → "Back Door Interior Transmission → Interior Tuner".</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check that the wireless door lock buzzer sounds (beep, beep...) when the electrical key transmitter is placed in the luggage compartment.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>The buzzer sounding confirms that the interior transmitter is operating normally.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<table>
<title>Result: </title>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.82in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.31in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Any of front, rear or luggage cannot be confirmed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>All of front, rear and luggage can be confirmed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001HXC00IX_04_0004" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000001HXC00IX_04_0025" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
